Analysis of concurrency intricacies, memory ordering, performance trade-offs (lock-free fast-paths vs. retries), and real-world evaluation via NUMA-aware workloads would follow in subsequent iterations. If desired, **simulated-specific increments (e.g., search for Node48)** could be also detailed.

